# =============================================================================
# CODEOWNERS — Path-Scoped Governance Boundary
# =============================================================================
# Note: When hosted in GitHub (recommended out-of-band control plane), this file
# enforces mandatory Platform Admin approval on the Baseline Engine & AI Guardrails
# while allowing Maintainers to approve routine changes to config/ dials.
#
# If this repo is mirrored or hosted in Azure Repos, the equivalent path-filtered
# reviewer policies are enforced by `modules/self-governance-policies/`.
# =============================================================================

# Default owner for everything in the repository
*                                       @org/azdo-platform-admins

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tier 2 & Tier 3 Maintainer Surface ("The Dials")
# Maintainers can review and approve routine project onboarding & dial changes,
# EXCEPT org.yaml which affects the entire Azure DevOps Organization.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/config/projects/                       @org/azdo-maintainers @org/azdo-platform-admins
/config/groups.yaml                     @org/azdo-maintainers @org/azdo-platform-admins
/config/org.yaml                        @org/azdo-platform-admins

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tier 1 Protected Engine, Schemas, Policies & AI Guardrails
# Strictly requires Platform Admin approval.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/modules/                               @org/azdo-platform-admins
/environments/                          @org/azdo-platform-admins
/schemas/                               @org/azdo-platform-admins
/policies/                              @org/azdo-platform-admins
/scripts/                               @org/azdo-platform-admins
/.agents/                               @org/azdo-platform-admins
/.github/                               @org/azdo-platform-admins
/AGENTS.md                              @org/azdo-platform-admins
/GEMINI.md                              @org/azdo-platform-admins
